<blockquote>
<p>[ACWCY]'s addition came simply from Yoric proclaiming the invention of a new group of interest, which was added to the list.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>This is simply untrue. Voct added the entry on April 14th, 2012, the day after he rewrote <a href="/scp-1057">SCP-1057</a><sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-132225-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-132225-1')">1</a></sup>. If I recall correctly, it had three articles and a tale at the time. Yoric wrote <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/look-at-me-im-inventing-a-new-group-of-interest|Coming">Soon To An Art Gallery Near You~</a> in November of 2011. I dunno if it was your intent or not, but you make it seem like Yoric declared AWCY? to be a thing through fiat, which is not at all what happened.</p>
